        "He reads Romans 5:19 as a mirror: ‘as by the disobedience of the one man who was originally moulded from virgin soil, the many were made sinners… so was it necessary that, by the obedience of one man, who was originally born from a virgin, many should be justified and receive salvation’ (3.18.7). Adam from untouched earth; Christ from a virgin.",
