        "Then Jesus prays that his followers would be one ‘even as you, Father, are in me, and I in you, that they also may be one in us’ (17:21). He asks that ‘the love with which you loved me may be in them, and I in them’ (17:26). The love between Father and Son is meant to be shared.",
